e (Infinite Damage) feature does not work on Delta Mobile, it does not provide additional damage or a one-time attack for boss raids. I have tried both scripts, but the other features are excellent.\nThe message that appears when I try to scan the weapon is: \n\n[18:20:12] Button error (SCAN): ELuTmhXAGLAmkrbvEauMiekjK:3: missing argument #1","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-03-10T11:26:45.706Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69b009ab9994db3519ed5b3a","commentBy":{"_id":"699aea7bd99a27bd70724f5b","username":"Meerly","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-05-12T08:34:34.137Z","createdAt":"2026-02-22T11:37:31.841Z","status":"offline","id":"699aea7bd99a27bd70724f5b","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"@Gugugaga00 I'll do some testing later and see what I can get done, thanks for letting me know the log!","parent":{"_id":"69affff543eb3299c582df37","commentBy":{"_id":"69affcf4942b0cf7aa45c841","username":"Gugugaga00","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"69affcf4942b0cf7aa45c841"},"text":"The Weapon Override (Infinite Damage) feature does not work on Delta Mobile, it does not provide additional damage or a one-time attack for boss raids. I have tried both scripts, but the other features are excellent.\nThe message that appears when I try to scan the weapon is: \n\n[18:20:12] Button error (SCAN): ELuTmhXAGLAmkrbvEauMiekjK:3: missing argument #1"},"edited":false,"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-03-10T12:08:11.636Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69b00e6611afc6c1a5c2bd9b","commentBy":{"_id":"699aea7bd99a27bd70724f5b","username":"Meerly","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-05-12T08:34:34.137Z","createdAt":"2026-02-22T11:37:31.841Z","status":"offline","id":"699aea7bd99a27bd70724f5b","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"@Gugugaga00 Should be fixed now, just added a hardened call to ensure it either works, or tells you explicitely why it doesn't. Have fun!","parent":{"_id":"69affff543eb3299c582df37","commentBy":{"_id":"69affcf4942b0cf7aa45c841","username":"Gugugaga00","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"69affcf4942b0cf7aa45c841"},"text":"The Weapon Override (Infinite Damage) feature does not work on Delta Mobile, it does not provide additional damage or a one-time attack for boss raids. I have tried both scripts, but the other features are excellent.\nThe message that appears when I try to scan the weapon is: \n\n[18:20:12] Button error (SCAN): ELuTmhXAGLAmkrbvEauMiekjK:3: missing argument #1"},"edited":false,"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-03-10T12:28:22.769Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69b0324fdfe464b918afb8d1","commentBy":{"_id":"69affcf4942b0cf7aa45c841","username":"Gugugaga00","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-03-31T02:24:19.232Z","createdAt":"2026-03-10T11:13:56.249Z","status":"offline","id":"69affcf4942b0cf7aa45c841","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"I just set the damage to 250000000, after which a log appeared with the message: [21:54:41] Weapon damage override applied: 250000000.\n\nThe log shows that it worked, but the damage was not applied in the game.\n\nI tested it against raid bosses and mobs, but there was no additional damage and it was still normal, just like the original damage.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-03-10T15:01:35.109Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69b0538c43eb3299c588850e","commentBy":{"_id":"699aea7bd99a27bd70724f5b","username":"Meerly","verified":false,"role":"user","profile